#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:20
#: 41e3a2b92c474fdbbcdb05e030cf940f
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all          # Python 3.12 env; installs ros2-viser among other"
" submodules\n"
"./run.sh viser\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all          # Python 3.12 env; installs ros2-viser among other"
" submodules\n"
"./run.sh viser\n"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:27
#: bb589279c6744729ba5a94163749b9ee
msgid ""
"`./run.sh` with no arguments opens a menu; item 1 is `ros2-viser launch`."
" See [fa-py-libraries](2-fa_py_libraries.md)."
msgstr ""
"`./run.sh` 不带参数会打开菜单；第 1 项是 `ros2-viser launch`。见 [fa-py-"
"libraries](2-fa_py_libraries.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:29
#: 80e09071115e476fb10d1b1d9480338c
msgid ""
"lerobot_ros2 / robot_action_composer may list a PyPI extra `viser>=0.2` "
"for grasp-generation UI. That is a **library dependency**, not the "
"ros2-viser launcher."
msgstr ""
"lerobot_ros2 / robot_action_composer 可能列出 PyPI extra `viser>=0.2` 用于抓取生成 "
"UI。那是**库依赖**，不是 ros2-viser 启动器。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:31
#: c30501837d0a4a058ca36155b3fd0ff5
