#: df24cf5538d6487d96528f31fc40fb08
msgid "When you are working on the `ros2_viser` tree itself (from the README):"
msgstr "在 `ros2_viser` 源码树里开发时（来自 README）："

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:35
#: 99e253c58f4e4d1c9e7401008b9381c2
msgid ""
"cd ros2_viser\n"
"pip install -e .\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ros2_viser\n"
"pip install -e .\n"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:40
#: 07b2d0fb82034096a8aab0ccd90852d1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Requires `ros2-robot-interface`. The stack entry is the deploy workspace "
"/ `fa-py-libraries`, not `pip install ros2-viser` from an arbitrary venv."
msgstr "需要 `ros2-robot-interface`。不要把随便一个虚拟环境里的 `pip install ros2-viser` 当成技术栈主入口。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:42
#: 1e41ad6afe9b4064ab850fc31c29ade6
msgid "Embedding (README API)"
msgstr "嵌入（README API）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:44
#: 2075252f70d44511b8448132fb848238
msgid ""
"Class names below match the package README (`ROS2ViserVisualizer` / "
"`ROS2ViserConfig`). There is no `ViserVisualizer` class in this repo."
msgstr ""
"下列类名与软件包 README 一致（`ROS2ViserVisualizer` / `ROS2ViserConfig`）。本仓库没有 "
"`ViserVisualizer` 类。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:46
#: f714139b52c440aa96276709b7911a70
msgid ""
"from ros2_viser import ROS2ViserVisualizer, ROS2ViserConfig\n"
"import time\n"
"\n"
"config = ROS2ViserConfig(\n"
"    robot_description_topic=\"/robot_description\",\n"
"    joint_states_topic=\"/joint_states\",\n"
"    root_node_name=\"/robot\",\n"
"    update_rate=30.0,\n"
")\n"
"visualizer = ROS2ViserVisualizer(config)\n"
"visualizer.start()\n"
"try:\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        time.sleep(1)\n"
"except KeyboardInterrupt:\n"
"    visualizer.stop()\n"
msgstr ""
"from ros2_viser import ROS2ViserVisualizer, ROS2ViserConfig\n"
"import time\n"
"\n"
"config = ROS2ViserConfig(\n"
"    robot_description_topic=\"/robot_description\",\n"
"    joint_states_topic=\"/joint_states\",\n"
"    root_node_name=\"/robot\",\n"
"    update_rate=30.0,\n"
")\n"
"visualizer = ROS2ViserVisualizer(config)\n"
"visualizer.start()\n"
"try:\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        time.sleep(1)\n"
"except KeyboardInterrupt:\n"
"    visualizer.stop()\n"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:65
#: 3cac1bf023234408b5644a44e06bc071
msgid ""
"Config fields documented in the README: `robot_description_topic`, "
"`joint_states_topic`, `root_node_name`, `update_rate`, `auto_connect`, "
"`enable_fsm_panel`, `enable_gripper_panel`."
msgstr ""
"README "
"中的配置字段：`robot_description_topic`、`joint_states_topic`、`root_node_name`、`update_rate`、`auto_connect`、`enable_fsm_panel`、`enable_gripper_panel`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:67
#: 1fba710a120f44fdb4dd3e94298db5fa
msgid ""
"Needs `/robot_description` and `/joint_states` publishing. Joint names "
"must match the URDF."
msgstr "需要正在发布 `/robot_description` 与 `/joint_states`。关节名必须与 URDF 一致。"

